          "softCap1": 18,
          "softCap2": 50,
          "softCap3": 60,
          "softCap4": 80,
          "wikiUrl": "https://eldenring.wiki.gg/wiki/Strength",
          "note": "Increases your strength and when two-handing, multiplies your strength by 50%. For accurate stats, use a Weapon Calculator , select a weapon with \"Heavy\" as the affinity, and play with the strength stat until you see diminishing returns.",
          "noteLinks": [
