          "softCap2": 50,
          "softCap3": 60,
          "softCap4": 80,
          "wikiUrl": "https://eldenring.wiki.gg/wiki/Dexterity",
          "note": "Increases your dexterity and spell casting speed. Use the abovementioned weapon calculator with a \"Keen\" affinity to find your weapons soft cap. Casting speed caps at 70 dexterity."
        },
        {
          "stat": "Intelligence (Weapon)",
