  "notes": [
    {
      "topic": "Vigor",
      "text": "Increases your HP. Getting 40 Vigor early makes the early-mid game much easier. Since you can get a +5 Somber weapon and upgraded flasks early, you can be tanking and killing most enemies with little investment.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "Mind",
      "text": "Increases your mana bar. Most builds will be fine between 15-40 Mind depending on how many spells or weapon skills you use.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "Endurance",
      "text": "Increases your stamina and equip load. Level based on how much stamina and equip load your armor and weapons need. You typically want to end between 30-50 Endurance.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "Strength",
      "text": "Increases your strength and when two-handing, multiplies your strength by 50%. For accurate stats, use a Weapon Calculator , select a weapon with \"Heavy\" as the affinity, and play with the strength stat until you see diminishing returns.",
      "links": [
        {
          "label": "Weapon Calculator",
          "url": "https://www.tarnished.dev/weapon-calculator"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "Dexterity",
      "text": "Increases your dexterity and spell casting speed. Use the abovementioned weapon calculator with a \"Keen\" affinity to find your weapons soft cap. Casting speed caps at 70 dexterity.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "Intelligence",
      "text": "Increases your ability to cast sorceries. Use a Casting Tool Comparator to find out which staff is best for your build.",
      "links": [
        {
          "label": "Casting Tool Comparator",
          "url": "https://jerp.tv/eldenring/spelltools/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "Faith",
      "text": "Increases your ability to cast incantations. Use the abovementioned casting tool comparator to find out which seal is best for your build.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "Arcane",
      "text": "Increases the damage of arcane-scaling weapons and the amount of status buildup it inflicts. Additionally, leveling this stat increases your Item Discovery (1 per point, up to 99).",
      "links": [
        {
          "label": "Item Discovery",
          "url": "https://eldenring.wiki.gg/wiki/Discovery"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "topic": "Build",
      "text": "If you know what equipment you'll use, you can min-max your class and stats with a Build Planner .",
      "links": [
        {
          "label": "Build Planner",
          "url": "https://eip.gg/elden-ring/build-planner/"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "buildRecommendation": {
    "heading": "General recommendation:",
    "items": [
      {
        "text": "Reach level requirements for your desired weapon, casting tool, or spell.",
        "links": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Level Vigor to 40. Most of your HP gains come between levels 28-40, and leveling damage stats provides little benefit due to weapons having poor scaling at low levels.",
        "links": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Get enough stamina to comfortably use your weapons and reach medium roll equip load.",
        "links": []
